# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization.
# loov: 所有平台检出都用 LF——Windows 构建机默认 core.autocrlf=true，没写 eol 的文本（如 *.svg）
# 会被转成 CRLF，打出来的前端资源哈希和 macOS / Linux 不同（0.1.4 实测），各平台包不一致
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly declare text files you want to always be normalized and converted
# to native line endings on checkout.
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf

# TypeScript/JavaScript files
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf

# HTML/CSS files
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.scss text eol=lf

# Shell scripts
*.sh text eol=lf

# Denote all files that are truly binary and should not be modified.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.icns binary
*.bmp binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
